; Unit tests of the grades: the security levels, the products of grades, the
; literals of every grade, the four implementations of the regular trace grade,
; by automata and by three kinds of derivatives, the regular trace grades of
; timed operations with their closures, the sets of delays, the timed regular
; expressions with the regular trace grade over rational delays, and the regular
; trace grades of timed operations over rational delays with their closures; the
; sets of delays against an implementation by lists of intervals; the laws of
; every registered grade, on samples, by the checks the tests share; the
; operation-spacing grade against concrete computations; the non-rigid
; grades of timed operations against their translations into the grades with
; interval letters; and the run consistency of the intervals with interval
; letters against the reference.

